-- Medhour Pharmacy — catalogue seed
--
-- GENERATED FILE — do not edit by hand.
--   python3 scripts/build_catalogue.py   (reads MEDHOUR PRICE LIST.xlsx)
--   python3 scripts/build_seed.py        (writes this file)
--
-- 692 products in 17 categories, taken from the
-- pharmacy's own stock list. Prices are the sheet's Selling Price and stock
-- is its On Hand column, both copied verbatim.
--
-- No product images are seeded: every product starts with an empty image
-- container, to be filled in from Admin -> Products -> Edit -> Images.

-- Run after the migrations in supabase/migrations/.

